Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|dictionary|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Util|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Dictionary Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dictionary Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Dictionary|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Find Dictionary Word
Priority: 2
	Given TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Dictionary Page|
	And Dictionary find PG
		|dictionaryWord|dog|
	And these variables
		|key_dictionaryTerm|dog|
	And SelectWindow at locator 'title=Dog | Define Dog at Dictionary.com'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'dog' at locator 'Portlet#WORD'
	And Close at locator 'title=Dog | Define Dog at Dictionary.com'
	Then SelectWindow at locator 'title=Dictionary Page - ${siteName}'